{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/fff3881adaa3a86d01765228b67ba37b.avif?t=1767216905\" width=761 height=476 /></span><strong></strong><br> <strong>Robot Rhapsody is a 'new-retro' cinematic RPG set in a future world on the edges of machine singularity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25 Challenging turn-based combat, inspired by classic RPGs.<br>\u2699\ufe0f HACK robot enemies to join the party. UPGRADE them all with distinct items and parts.<br>\ud83d\udca5 Story\u00a0Themes touching AI, futurism, cultism, dystopias, and transcendence.<br><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Open-ended exploration.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/fb0fdcf13b6a01c5885adaf1762df8e0.avif?t=1767216905\" width=761 height=476 /></span><br> <br><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Follow Selva, a cynical luddite mercenary.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formerly trained to hunt \u201crogue\u201d robots, she now lives off-grid in exile.  <br>Yet new events drag her back to the technocratic future she can\u2019t escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Her ally is\u00a0Jiro, a boy raised entirely within the <u>Aethar Hives</u></strong>; <br>Underground bomb shelters that have been transformed into AI-controlled \u201cutopias.\u201d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jiro's every move is micromanaged by \u201cgodlike\u201d AGI, robots, photo-real VR, and negative-emotion-suppressing systems</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Despite their opposite nature, the two are ultimately drawn together. <br>A reluctant friendship that sparks widespread rebellion.</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/bab18db91e33418364cb47f13d511f4c.avif?t=1767216905\" width=761 height=476 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5\u00a0</strong>Explore a war-scorched former metropolis; <u>Zoxxo City</u>. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various new neighborhoods, shortcuts, quests, &amp; secrets appear incrementally as the story unfolds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful street vendors, machine smugglers, stem-cell harvesters, cultish luddites, and a deranged robotic carnival troupe are among dozens of NPCs you'll encounter. Inspired by Majora's Mask, they each have their own evolving schedules.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/bf395802040eb1683109f2bae5ba9aec.avif?t=1767216905\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/bf395802040eb1683109f2bae5ba9aec.webp?t=1767216905 width=1560 height=1601 /></span><u>Navigate the BOUNTY system</u>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will be hunted by malevolent robots</strong>, <u>to a greater or lesser extent</u>, stemming from player choices!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain the chance to Inflict</strong> <strong>machine-specific status effects,</strong> such as <strong><u>SHORT-CIRCUIT</u>\u00a0(electric stun)</strong>, and <strong><u>VIRUS</u> (confused/berserk behavior),\u00a0</strong>to disadvantage the robot foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain characters can use\u00a0<strong><u>HACK</u></strong>, forcing some robotic enemies to fight alongside the party\u2014or even upgrade them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike human allies; once robot allies reach K/O status, they're gone forever.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.poster.avif?t=1767216905\" width=594 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.webm?t=1767216905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d9ae6630b30c97f22ab1d819fcc733fd.mp4?t=1767216905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1767216905\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1767216905 width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unlike Beloved Rapture, our previous title</i> - <strong><u>in Robot Rhapsody, most of the game's world will be completely open from the very start of the game</u></strong>, encouraging greater replay value, and player-defined consequences. The sprawling world offers freedom for the player to chart their own path - yet the &quot;main story&quot; remains cinematic/linear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1767216905\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras_big/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1767216905 width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758170?t=1767216905","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.