aged tech, &amp; explore bizarre pockets of human resistance.","steam_appid":3758170,"support_info":{"email":"RapturousGames@Gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}